      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    face_value = 10000\n    coupon_rate = 0.05\n    discount_rate = 0.04\n    years_to_maturity = 5\n    annual_coupon = face_value * coupon_rate\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    present_value_coupons = sum(\n        annual_coupon / ((1 + discount_rate) ** year)\n        for year in range(1, years_to_maturity + 1)\n    )\n    present_value_face_value = face_value / ((1 + discount_rate) ** years_to_maturity)\n    bond_value = present_value_coupons + present_value_face_value\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to the nearest integer\n    return round(bond_value)\n```",
